# Curated NMOS 6502 opcode subset for the Tom Harte ProcessorTests CTest gate.
# Format: <opcode-hex> <sha256>  - one upstream file per line, fetched from
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SingleStepTests/65x02/main/6502/v1/<op>.json
# Each file holds 10 000 single-instruction vectors. This subset spans every
# addressing-mode timing class + the historically fragile paths (RMW, branch
# page-cross, JMP-indirect NMOS bug, JSR/RTS/BRK/RTI, PLP flag-load, decimal
# ADC/SBC). POM2's NMOS core passes ALL of these 100% (140 000 vectors).
# Run the full 256-opcode set with tests/fetch_tomharte.sh for exhaustive runs.
